BACKEND
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
x402 Payment Gateway for Autonomous AI Agents
Network: Morph Hoodi Testnet (Chain ID: 2910)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WHAT IT DOES
- Implements the x402 payment-as-authentication protocol
- AI agents discover APIs on-chain, pay per call, receive data — zero human approval
- Gateway mediates on-chain settlement via X402Facilitator.sol
- Providers register APIs on-chain via APIRegistry.sol
- Rich API metadata (docs, params, code examples) stored off-chain in Supabase
- Every payment is signed, verified, and settled on Morph L2
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
STATUS
[/] x402 middleware (HTTP 402 challenge / X-Payment header)
[/] Signature verification (ECDSA off-chain)
[/] On-chain settlement via X402Facilitator.settle(payer, ...)
[/] Dual-layer nonce protection (in-memory + on-chain)
[/] APIRegistry integration (read + write)
[/] Startup registry sync (live on-chain prices)
[/] Generic proxy route (any registered API callable)
[/] Payment ledger (in-memory, per-call history, replayed from chain on restart)
[/] Marketplace catalog endpoint
[/] Dashboard endpoints (wallet spend history)
[/] Provider portal endpoints (earnings, call history)
[/] Single X-Payment header (base64 JSON)
[/] chainId in 402 response
[/] Demo agent script (autonomous multi-call simulation)
[/] Off-chain metadata service (Supabase — category, tags, docs, params, examples)
[/] Metadata endpoints (POST/GET /registry/metadata/:id)
[/] Slug routing (/registry/slug/:slug)
[/] Category listing (/registry/categories)
[/] Enriched marketplace listing (on-chain + metadata merged)
[/] Unified call route — all APIs (built-in + provider) via /api/v1/call/:apiId
[/] Built-in feeds auto-registered on-chain at startup (no special-casing)
[ ] Playground endpoint (/api/v1/playground/:apiId)
[ ] Wallet-signature-based metadata auth (EIP-712)
[ ] Search query param (?search=) on /registry/apis
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GETTING STARTED
    1. Build contracts (required before starting backend)
            cd packages/contracts
            forge build
    2. Deploy contracts to Morph Hoodi (if not already deployed)
            see packages/contracts/GETTING_STARTED
    3. Configure environment
            cp apps/backend/.env.example apps/backend/.env
            # Fill in all values — see ENVIRONMENT section below
    4. (Optional) Set up Supabase for API metadata
            # Create a project at https://supabase.com
            # Run the SQL in src/services/metadata.service.ts in the SQL editor
            # Add SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY to .env
            # Without these, metadata endpoints return 503 — all other routes work fine
    5. Move into backend folder
            cd apps/backend
    6. Install dependencies
            pnpm install
    7. Start server
            pnpm dev
            # Server runs at http://localhost:3001
    8. Run demo agent (optional)
            node scripts/agent.mjs
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ENVIRONMENT
    RPC_URL                   Morph Hoodi RPC (https://rpc-hoodi.morphl2.io)
    CHAIN_NAME                morph_hoodi
    GATEWAY_PRIVATE_KEY       Server wallet private key (pays gas for settle())
    AGENT_PRIVATE_KEY         Agent wallet private key (used by demo scripts)
    API_REGISTRY_ADDRESS      Deployed APIRegistry.sol address
    X402_FACILITATOR_ADDRESS  Deployed X402Facilitator.sol address
    USDC_ADDRESS              Deployed MockUSDC address
    PROVIDER_ADDRESS          Wallet that receives 99% of API payments
    TREASURY_ADDRESS          Wallet that receives 1% platform fee
    FACILITATOR_DEPLOY_BLOCK  Block number when X402Facilitator was deployed
                              (avoids scanning from block 0 on startup)

    ── Supabase (optional — off-chain API metadata) ──────────────────────────
    SUPABASE_URL              https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
    SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY Service role key (not the anon key)
